WEBVTT

00:10.160 --> 00:12.890
I just realized, Himuro-kun...

00:12.890 --> 00:15.240
You don't often make eye contact, do you?

00:17.000 --> 00:19.800
It's a bit embarrassing to admit at my age,

00:20.310 --> 00:23.490
but I have trouble maintaining eye contact.

00:23.490 --> 00:25.120
Maintaining it?

00:25.680 --> 00:27.650
I know how you feel, though.

00:28.750 --> 00:30.280
You do?

00:32.270 --> 00:34.570
Himuro-kun! What an interesting weakness!

00:34.570 --> 00:35.710
Weakness?

00:36.260 --> 00:38.370
In that case...

00:38.370 --> 00:42.760
Why don't we ask Fuyutsuki-san to train you?

00:42.760 --> 00:45.310
Train me? How?

00:45.310 --> 00:46.520
Very well.

00:49.350 --> 00:51.770
First, look at me.

00:51.770 --> 00:53.520
R-Right...

00:54.280 --> 00:55.790
You don't have to look into my eyes.

00:55.790 --> 00:57.780
You can just look at the bridge of my nose.

00:59.090 --> 01:00.270
The bridge of your nose?

01:00.780 --> 01:04.790
Here. Look at the bridge 
of my nose for ten seconds.

01:28.810 --> 01:31.660
I... I lose.

01:31.660 --> 01:33.240
Hang on!

01:33.240 --> 01:35.830
When did this become a staring contest?

01:36.330 --> 01:39.810
Really?! What a sore winner!

01:44.750 --> 01:46.510
She was so cute!

01:46.510 --> 01:49.000
So cute! So cute!

01:49.040 --> 01:51.000
<b>The Ice Guy and</b>

01:49.040 --> 01:51.000
